{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make all major supermarkets use a form of cover/shelter for all baked goods.",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "In many major stores, baked goods are open to contamination via physical touch, insects and more. We therefore call upon the government to require all supermarkets with a bakery section, to have some sort of cover for all bakery items to ensure hygiene is kept up to standard.",
